# Growing Rites of Itlimoc: "When it enters, look at the top four cards of your library. You may reveal a creature card from among them and put it into
# your hand. Put the rest on the bottom of your library in any order" (CR 701.20a, 401.4). The top four are Forest, Memnite, Ornithopter and Swamp: either
# creature card may be taken, a land may not (refused here, with Memnite taken on the next line as the positive control), and the other three go to the
# bottom in the order chosen. The Island below the four stays on top. Bot2's library is untouched.

